            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Assuming I've understood the code correctly, the conditions for the other events also look interesting...\r\n\r\n- `SessionWritePost` also fires for all of `:mk{session,view,vimrc,exrc}`\r\n- `SessionLoadPost` fires when loading a session _or_ view\r\n- `SessionLoadPre` fires only when loading a session\r\n\r\n_absolute cinema_ ✋👴🤚",
